{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["How long without a login or an order counts as churned for you, and when will this go out after that point?","Which reasons can you act on, and are they all in the list?","Who reads the answers from people who named a competitor, and what will they do with them?","Will someone actually email people who said they'd come back, and when?"],"howToUseResponses":"Split the answers by the first question, because people who cancelled and people who quietly stopped often leave for different reasons. Count the main reasons each month and watch how the mix moves, because a rise in one reason after a price or product change tells you more than the total. Read the written follow-ups for your top reason in full, and group the missing features and competitor answers into themes. Put the people who left an email into a short list, and when you fix what they asked for, tell them.","customizeSteps":["Edit the reason list to match why your customers really leave, and keep the follow-up for each one that stays.","Send the link to customers who cancelled and to accounts that have gone quiet for the period you chose, in the same email.","Read the answers weekly in the dashboard, or export them to CSV and tag each response by theme."],"faqs":[{"q":"What questions should a churn survey ask?","a":"Ask for the main reason first, then one follow-up specific to that reason, when the product stopped feeling worth it, and whether anything would bring them back. Keep it short, because people who are leaving owe you nothing."},{"q":"When is the best time to send a churn survey?","a":"At the moment of cancelling or within a day of it, while the reason is still clear. For customers who drift away without cancelling, send it after a set period of inactivity."},{"q":"What is the difference between a churn survey and a cancellation survey?","a":"A cancellation survey is shown during the act of cancelling. A churn survey can also reach people who stopped using the product without formally leaving."},{"q":"How do I get more people to answer a churn survey?","a":"Keep it to a couple of minutes, say plainly that the answers shape what gets fixed, and ask only the follow-ups that fit their reason. A conversational format helps because it feels like a quick exchange rather than a form."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Churn survey","description":"Learn why customers left or went quiet, and when the product stopped being worth it.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_churnsur00","ref":"welcome","title":"We noticed you've stepped away, and we'd like to understand why. It takes two minutes and shapes what we fix next.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_churnsur01","ref":"status","title":"Which of these fits you best?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_i_cancelled_my","label":"I cancelled my account","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_still_have","label":"I still have an account but stopped using it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_m_about","label":"I'm about to cancel","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur02","ref":"used_for","title":"What did you mainly use us for?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":200},{"id":"blk_churnsur03","ref":"tenure","title":"How long were you with us?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_less_than_a","label":"Less than a month","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_1_6_months","label":"1–6 months","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_6_12_months","label":"6–12 months","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_more_than_a","label":"More than a year","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur04","ref":"reason","title":"What's the main reason you're leaving?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_it_cost_too","label":"It cost too much for what I got","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_was_missing","label":"It was missing something I needed","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_switched_to","label":"I switched to another product","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_was_hard","label":"It was hard to use","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_too_many_bugs","label":"Too many bugs or problems","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_wasn_t","label":"I wasn't using it enough","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_my_needs_changed","label":"My needs changed","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_else","label":"Something else","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur05","ref":"cheaper_plan","title":"Would a cheaper option with fewer features have kept you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_churnsur06","ref":"missing","title":"What was missing? Tell us what you were trying to do.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur07","ref":"competitor","title":"Which product did you move to?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_churnsur08","ref":"competitor_why","title":"What does it do better for you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur09","ref":"friction","title":"Tell us a bit more about what happened. A specific moment helps most.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur10","ref":"needs_changed","title":"What changed for you?","description":"For example, a new job, a finished project or a smaller team.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur11","ref":"low_use","title":"What got in the way of using it more often?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur12","ref":"when_value_dropped","title":"When did it stop feeling worth it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_right_from_the","label":"Right from the start","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_after_the_first","label":"After the first few weeks","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_after_months_of","label":"After months of use","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_only_recently","label":"Only recently","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_still_felt","label":"It still felt worth it, my situation changed","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur13","ref":"overall","title":"Overall, how would you rate your time with us?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"rating","scale":5,"shape":"star"},{"id":"blk_churnsur14","ref":"come_back","title":"Is there anything that would bring you back?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_churnsur15","ref":"bring_back","title":"What would it take?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_churnsur16","ref":"email","title":"If we fix it, can we let you know? Leave your ema